<html>
<title>Video Terminal Simulation</title>
<body>


<h1>Video Terminal Simulation</h1>

<p>
Four video terminal options are available:
</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://vt100.net/dec/ek-vt5x-op-001.pdf">VT52</a>: DEC VT52 video terminal simulation</li>
<li><a href="https://vt100.net/docs/vt100-ug/">VT100</a>: DEC VT100 video terminal simulation</li>
<li>External: use an external Windows or Linux software terminal</li>
<li>Loop: loopback option for use with emulation of video terminals such as VIS1801, VP3000, RCA APT VP4801 or VT1802</li>
</ul>

<p>
<strong>Note:</strong> The DEC terminals are simulators - the original terminal software is not used. Both terminals support ESC sequences and full functionality, except for self-test features and keyboard LEDs.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Note:</strong> Not all functionality has been tested, as no software exercises all features and no original hardware is available for verification.
</p>


